      "created_at": "2014-08-16T17:46:42.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>But if Absolute Zero has multiple Structures in play, and their radius has been buffed, he triggers each one he is within a radius of one from when he moves, correct?&nbsp; So if two of his three hexes are beside five of them then he will be hit by all five?&nbsp; If he moves further after that will he trigger them again if he remains in their radius of 1?</p>",
