      "name": "Ronway",
      "username": "Ronway",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-08-16T17:50:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Is there even a way to increase the radius of Impaling Structure?</p><p>Though I will use a real game problem, if Ra has Living Pyre and Blazing Tornado in play, next a Volcano, with two Raptors and if Omnitron-V enters all five of those with any of his hexes, then he is attacked by all five.&nbsp;If Omnitron-V moves, any of his other hexes enter a space that has just triggered a hazard space would not trigger again, because Omnitron-V is not entering the Hazard Space, one of his hexes are. Though any new hex he enters that has a hazard space will trigger.</p>",
