      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Ronway\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/48/1856_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Ronway:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Is there even a way to increase the radius of Impaling Structure?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I assumed it was affected by Fueled Freeze, but I could be wrong.&nbsp; It does say they're Hazard Attacks as opposed to Area Attacks, but since Fueled Freeze pluralized area attacks I assumed it meant more than just his Thermal Shockwave.</p>",
