      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-08-16T18:02:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Reckless\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/reckless/48/2467_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Reckless:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>Ronway wrote:</b><br><blockquote>Is there even a way to increase the radius of Impaling Structure?\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nI assumed it was affected by Fueled Freeze, but I could be wrong.&nbsp; It does say they're Hazard Attacks as opposed to Area Attacks, but since Fueled Freeze pluralized area attacks I assumed it meant more than just his Thermal Shockwave.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Fueled Freeze specifies it increases the radius of Absolute Zero's&nbsp;area&nbsp;attacks. Impaling Structures are a hazard attack. The reason why Fueled Freeze probably&nbsp;uses the plural of Area Attack is there is a possibility of adding more promo Power Cards which have Area Attacks on them. Or perhaps there will be something that gives characters an attack in a Scenario.</p>",
