      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "[quote=\"Reckless\"]\n\n&nbsp;\n<div class=\"bb-quote\"><b>Ronway wrote:</b><br /><blockquote class=\"bb-quote-body\">Is there even a way to increase the radius of Impaling Structure?\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nI assumed it was affected by Fueled Freeze, but I could be wrong.&nbsp; It does say they&#39;re Hazard Attacks as opposed to Area Attacks, but since Fueled Freeze pluralized area attacks I assumed it meant more than just his Thermal Shockwave.\n\n[/quote]\n\nFueled Freeze specifies it increases the radius of Absolute Zero&#39;s&nbsp;area&nbsp;attacks. Impaling Structures are a hazard attack. The reason why Fueled Freeze probably&nbsp;uses the plural of Area Attack is there is a possibility of adding more promo Power Cards which have Area Attacks on them. Or perhaps there will be something that gives characters an attack in a Scenario.\n",
      "actions_summary": [],
