      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dpt/{size}/1922_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-08-17T11:44:16.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So, Luther, Absolute Zero can be damaged by his own Impaling Structures, and Ambuscade can be damaged by his own traps?</p>\n<p>(These are not Companions so your previous answer does not quite apply)</p>",
