    {
      "id": 114911,
      "name": "phantaskippy",
      "username": "phantaskippy",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-08-17T14:18:18.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If Absolute Zero was the source of the hazard attack then he would need line of sight and range would be from AZ to the target.</p><p>Impaling structures create the hazard spaces, they deal the attack.</p><p>Just like Tornado is the source of the attack for the hazard spaces it creates, not Ra.</p><p>Ra and Operative are the source of the hazard spaces and the attack for their hazard spaces. &nbsp;Just like Turret bot creates its own attack and traps create their own attacks.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I don't know if Ra or AZ can be damaged by their structures/tornado, but I think they aren't due to that card still being their power.</p>",
      "post_number": 17,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:46:56.522Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
