      "read": true,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>If Absolute Zero was the source of the hazard attack then he would need line of sight and range would be from AZ to the target.</p><p>Impaling structures create the hazard spaces, they deal the attack.</p><p>Just like Tornado is the source of the attack for the hazard spaces it creates, not Ra.</p><p>Ra and Operative are the source of the hazard spaces and the attack for their hazard spaces. &nbsp;Just like Turret bot creates its own attack and traps create their own attacks.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I don&#39;t know if Ra or AZ can be damaged by their structures/tornado, but I think they aren&#39;t due to that card still being their power.</p>",
