    {
      "id": 114912,
      "name": "Sonvar",
      "username": "Powerhound_2000",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-08-17T14:42:12.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>AZ can be damaged by his own hazards as impaling structure makes no mention about whether it ignore allies. &nbsp; Baron Blade's turret in his second scenario do specifically say they don't hit allies. &nbsp; &nbsp;AZ also has the one power card to allow him and allies within 1 hex to ignore hazards. &nbsp;</p>",
