      "read": true,
      "user_title": "",
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>AZ can be damaged by his own hazards as impaling structure makes no mention about whether it ignore allies. &nbsp; Baron Blade&#39;s turret in his second scenario do specifically say they don&#39;t hit allies. &nbsp; &nbsp;AZ also has the one power card to allow him and allies within 1 hex to ignore hazards. &nbsp;</p>",
