      "raw": "[quote=\"Powerhound_2000\"]\n\nAZ can be damaged by his own hazards as impaling structure makes no mention about whether it ignore allies. &nbsp; Baron Blade&#39;s turret in his second scenario do specifically say they don&#39;t hit allies.&nbsp;&nbsp;\n\n[/quote]\n\nThe turrets are targets and are not power cards. Impaling Structures are not targets and are power cards. They are not really comparable cards. While the origin of the attack is located on the Impaling Structure, it is still one of Absolute Zero&#39;s attacks. All targets are immune to their own attacks, this makes Absolute Zero immune to Impaling Structure.\n",
